# TSB-366 — local-only run artifacts, never committed.
#
# The root .gitignore lists exact paths only, so a new directory needs its own
# guard (the same gap TSB-362 hit). Test logs and junit XML are locally
# reproducible; committing them would bloat the repo and could carry machine
# paths from a failed run.
*.local.json
*.local.txt
*.local.xml
*.local.*
